Original commit body from 8d5ec0402c240a3d9bb0e68efa5b2539c6d64484:

The flag was declared with help text "Daemonize and write PID file" and
documented in serve.py's docstring and the README, but `_cmd_serve` never
read it and `run_server` always ran uvicorn in the foreground (WI-robug,
found by the 2026-10-14 docstring-staleness audit; `git log -S` shows it
was never wired). Owner ruling 2026-10-16: remove the promise rather than
implement daemonization, since serve is not about to be used. `--stop` and
`--status` are unchanged; the docstring now says how to keep the server
alive past the shell.

